[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         // src buffer is exactly 3 floats followed by a poison page-adjacent
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         // guard we assert is untouched; dest is exactly 2 followed by canaries
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m         // (diff_disjoint already appends and checks 8 canary slots).
